OL,3,GNEWSA'Dive bar' clarifies My Chemical
OL,4,ARomance gig mix-up
OL,5,
OL,6,FBar staff with an upcoming themed My
OL,7,FChemical Romance night were shocked to
OL,8,Fsee ticket sales soar and get messages
OL,9,Fasking about an upcoming gig.
OL,11,FAaron Lythe, owner of Play
OL,12,FMiddlesbrough, said he was relaxing at
OL,13,Fhome when he began to get a wave of
OL,14,Fnotifications from friends telling him
OL,15,Fit is nice to see him "booking bigger
OL,16,Fbands".
OL,18,FLythe said Skiddle, the ticket sellers
OL,19,Ffor the October theme night, had tagged
OL,20,FMy Chemical Romance to the event
OL,21,Fdescription and it looked like they
OL,22,Fwere actually doing a gig.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
